#: ../../source/api_Dispatcher.md:1297
msgid ""
"**Note**: For HTTP/2, this event is also emitted when the dispatcher has "
"received the [GOAWAY Frame](https://webconcepts.info/concepts/http2"
"-frame-type/0x7) with an Error with the message `HTTP/2: \"GOAWAY\" frame"
" received` and the code `UND_ERR_INFO`. Due to nature of the protocol of "
"using binary frames, it is possible that requests gets hanging as a frame"
" can be received between the `HEADER` and `DATA` frames. It is "
"recommended to handle this event and close the dispatcher to create a new"
" HTTP/2 session."
